  "worked_solution": "The light aircraft is decelerating when its acceleration is negative. In a speed-time graph, the acceleration is given by the slope of the line. So, we need to find the times for which the slope is negative.\n\nWe see from the graph that the slope is negative from $t=0\\,\\text{min}$ to $t=3\\,\\text{min}.$ Therefore, the light aircraft is decelerating in this time interval.",
